// # Unified Topological Data Analysis (TDA), Persistent Homology & Mapper Facade
//
// Logline: Master facade re-exporting all 49 TDA, persistent homology, simplicial filtration, metric space, and Mapper modules.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim and unified API importing all companion submodules in tda_topology.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular Vietoris-Rips, Alpha, Cech, Cubical, Barcode, Landscape, Wasserstein, and Mapper submodules.
//   2. Re-export public topological configurations, constructors, metrics, and vectorization shims.
//   3. Maintain full backwards compatibility and uniform type access for openOODA topological analysis applications.

